9m resolved, this time you can go to hell."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Cigarette, it's over, I turn the page,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "I\u2019ll breathe fresh air, free from your cage,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "And if I fail, I'll try again without despair,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "For my will is strong, I want to live without smoke, with care."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}